t(19, 1040, """I have observed from life experience that a woman who asks her husband for divorce because he is poor is punished in this world with regret, while the same does not befall the one who asks her husband for divorce because he took another wife ((when she is a righteous woman who made every effort to make him happy)). For his marrying over her ((when she has exerted all her effort to make him happy)) may cause her psychological harm, because she made the effort and wore herself out for his happiness and was not an ungrateful wife who hurt him; so it is natural that she suffers psychological pain. This is unlike the husband's poverty, which is a trial for him and for her together: she is refusing a test from Allah that she is able to fulfil. His marrying over her, however, is a test she may not be able to fulfil. Here the difference appears between asking for divorce over the husband's poverty, since poverty is a test that both men and women can fulfil, and asking for divorce over his marriage, which is her test alone .. That is why we have seen many examples of women who asked for divorce because of (poverty) being exposed to worldly punishments that left them with regret and remorse. This post is not a call for our sisters to ask for divorce because of the husband's marriage; it is only to set out what has been observed from watching people's experiences in life.""")

t(19, 1805, """Among what is truly reported of the pains people have lived through, a real story that took place before the 1990 Gulf War

A man married his paternal cousin; they were residents of Riyadh. She married him reluctantly, because she was strikingly beautiful and wanted a rich husband. But she could not bear him for more than 6 months, reproaching him every day for his poverty and his modest condition. So he left her at her father's (his uncle's) house, with his children with her, and went to the Eastern Province. He came to a group of people and said to them: “I want a job that I finish and go straight to sleep; a job that makes me forget the whole world, otherwise I will die of grief.” He learned the contracting business, and there Allah opened the way for him in construction and he became rich. He married a woman who said to him, “Your children belong more rightly in their father's house,” so he brought them, and she was the best of mothers to them. Then his divorced wife married a rich man and had children by him; then he was arrested in a drug-trafficking case, so she was divorced and returned to her father's house, and he lodged her on the roof of the house, where he built her a room. Meanwhile her first husband returned to Riyadh with his children, bought a plot of land amid the houses of his family, built a luxurious house and settled in it. She began to stand at the door of her room on the roof of her father's house and look at the palace of her cousin, the father of her children. Her daughter by him had grown up, and she said to her father: “Father, do you have any need of my mother? She is poor and broken; would you not take her back as your wife?” So he recited verses of poetry the like of which, for pain, a person rarely hears, and said to his daughter, “Convey them to your mother.” He said:

I was broken in my pride, and you are the cause of my breaking
May Allah never bring back your nearness .. your nearness brings nothing but blame
Would that my Lord had not created you in my world, O my stumbling
I turned away after what happened, my grief a medal on my chest""")

t(20, 160, """And I swore: as long as you live, I will never again come to my homeland
I will withdraw in silence, or else die amid the crowd
Exile is more merciful to me than sitting and dying of my grief
And when you come to my mind, the world turns dark in my eyes
I draw you and burn your picture to cool my grief
I swear by the might of my Creator, Protector of the Sacred House
Even if you burn yourself with regret, I will not give you back my distance""")

t(20, 825, """The greatest fathers and mothers are the doers of good: those who, when shown affection little and rarely, give thanks; when cut off for a long time, excuse and show mercy; and when abandoned, love and show tenderness!

And the worst fathers and mothers are those who use the Book of Allah every day to set up daily gallows for their sons and daughters. When they are given what is within one's means, they are displeased; and when shown a little affection, they hate, take revenge, bear grudges and cut ties.

So choose whichever of the two kinds you wish, for a human being is human by his deeds, not his words. This religion came as a mercy to the worlds, to fathers and to children; fathers are of the worlds, and children are of the worlds. Whoever finds understanding hard will not understand even if a thousand articles are recited to him.""")

t(20, 1555, """In disciplined police work, the field is far more important than the offices .. A person feels doubly safe when he finds the command watching over its sons who have gone down into the streets infatuated with the police uniform, for among them is the doer of good and among them the oppressor""")

t(21, 575, """We were commanded to build the virtuous city .. and we were told that we will be held to account severely""")

t(21, 2005, """Look at this city and its sisters .. Fear and terror have filled it for a whole century .. Come, set out and prove to the people that you are their servants, not their masters""")

t(22, 1065, """Doing away with the stereotypical image of the policeman""")

t(22, 2415, """The fewer the cars bearing police markings, the more reassured society is! Especially societies that have long been seized by panic and terror at the mere sight of a police car. What harm is it to the policeman in his official uniform if his car is a civilian one? Gentleness with the frightened .. and gentleness with those who grew up and were raised to believe that the police are a ravenous beast .. Perhaps one of them passed along a street and saw a police car, having done nothing, yet because of the upbringing he was raised on, he may have had a heart attack.""")

t(23, 1600, """A question came to me via WhatsApp about the hadith “Have mercy on the noble of a people who has been humbled” .. Perhaps the global struggle is what prompted him to ask this question. Here is the answer in general, for the benefit of all.

The hadith is not an authentic hadith from the Prophet ﷺ, and attributing it to the Prophet ﷺ is not valid; it is among the weak or rejected hadiths according to the scholars of hadith. The hadith scholars are agreed on its weakness; Ibn Hibban mentioned it in the book “al-Majruhin”, and al-Albani and other hadith scholars described it as weak and not authentic.""")

t(23, 2235, """The amphitheatre of comparative religion .. Jerusalem's Hyde Park""")

t(24, 2500, """In the United States, a white American woman, not an immigrant, American for generations, 75 years old and extremely frail, the signs of infirmity and old age very plain on her, stands selling in a supermarket! No social security, no state aid, nothing at all! A young customer asks her: “Why are you working at this age?” She said: “Because""")

t(25, 160, """I am threatened with eviction from my home and I must pay the rent and the rent arrears. My husband died at 45 because of his drug use. I raised my children until they grew up, and now they do not care for me, do not support me with anything, and do not even keep in touch with me.” Then she began to cry!

Incidentally: this is one of the most important signs of the approach of the second universality of Islam, by the power of Allah the Exalted, and of the fall of the American dream.

And essentially: the suffering of human beings is a global suffering! It is not only those in the lands of Islam who suffer. This is a Christian mother who deserves to be honoured and helped, even if those who help her are the Muslims. This is the true message of the Muslims on earth .. the message of the Muslim servants helping all servants; as long as they are oppressed, they deserve help.""")

t(25, 1040, """An article to make known the true meaning of fatherhood and motherhood for the Muslim ((the doer of good, holder of the high rank in Islam)) and not the traditional Muslim .. and to refute a fallacy of Maryam Nour, because she presented a muddled model and built on it a muddled idea that does not stand up to logic!

By fate, a YouTube clip of Maryam Nour appeared to me, after she had reached the age she has reached. My comment is not on her but on an issue and an idea she raised, which the presenter who asked her the question did not correct! The presenter asked her about her daughter: why does she not keep in touch with her? Maryam said: “I left my daughter at the age of 18 because of the many problems between me and her; I left her and went to Osho.” And Osho, of course, is well known! Maryam continues: “My daughter does not contact me, and when I contact her she tells me, ‘I am busy’, and I do not know my grandchildren's names by heart!” The presenter asked her: “But she is your daughter in the end.” She replied: “I do not like to deal with my daughter through the door of motherhood and daughterhood; I like the relationship to be easy, without a mother's burdens towards her daughter, and this is the beautiful form of the relationship of children with fathers and mothers!”

My comment: there is a vast difference between my casting off my son or daughter and abandoning my responsibilities and then saying, “I will accept coldness from my son or daughter.” This is what Maryam Nour did; she presented a fallacious model, a muddled model for people. For the difference is vast between her (casting off) her daughter for the sake of Osho and joining him, and because she could not bear her daughter's adolescence, and there being a mother or father who made sacrifices for their children, who did not merely carry out the ordinary duty but offered many painful sacrifices, and then, when their responsibilities ended and the children grew up, said the very same words as Maryam: “We do not want to pursue our children in life with the burdens of fatherhood, motherhood and filial duty!”

The two models are extremely far apart and distinct! We are between a model whose title is: “I abandoned my responsibilities, and today I present myself as a human being”
and a model whose title is: “I did not offer only the duty but offered the sacrifices, and I truly deserve to be described as a human being when I really do not pursue my children with the tasks and burdens of fatherhood and motherhood”

The first model shows that the person is deceiving himself, or is oblivious to the fact that he made a grave mistake
And the second model is realistic, plain and correct, with no confusion in it, no obscurity and no muddled concept

So whoever sacrificed and did good to his children, and then did not pursue them with the exhausting burdens of fatherhood and motherhood, that is the human being, that is the human being, that is the human being

And whoever cast off and abandoned, and sought himself, his own self and his private pleasures, and then grows old and says, “I am a human being”, I say to him: Sorry .. I am not buying this""")

t(26, 395, """This is a lesson and an admonition for everyone who is bold against Allah, who seeks to share with Allah His unseen regarding people's destinies, who persists, is arrogant and plays god on earth. A lesson and an admonition for every madman and madwoman who have lost their minds

After a harm inflicted on me the day before yesterday by a human being from among those Allah created, a weak human who forgets the weakness of his humanity, forgets that he eats food, and forgets that his breaths are in the hand of Allah and may be cut off at any moment, the picture appeared to me by fate, after the night prayer, on YouTube's general page, where you do not necessarily have to be subscribed to a channel for its posts to appear to you, and after Surah Ghafir, which I also read by fate, not by choice, in the night prayer. What Ghafir contains is a declaration that is a message to a person who claims to know the destiny of others through his heart, who persists, argues and repeats the harm. So Surah Ghafir was a declaration, a reply and an exposure of the misguidance of everyone who claims that, and the fated picture on YouTube was a message to every person who does not fear Allah when he harms others; for many people are mindful not out of love for Allah the Almighty, but out of fear of Him.

O you who are astray, wherever you are, you will be resurrected and questioned about your playing god against Allah the Almighty, about your transgression against His servants and His creation, and about harming people. By Allah, not one of you will exceed his measure; you are nothing but people playing god against Allah and His unseen. Allah is only giving you respite, no more and no less, and He counts your breaths one by one.""")

h(26, 1500, """Indeed Allah returns harm to the one who harms, in the dearest thing he owns, so be at ease""")

t(26, 2440, """There is no succession on earth and no establishment for those who have taken from Islam prayers and Qur'an recitation ((only)), even if they pray a thousand rak'ahs and complete the Qur'an fifty times in a single day, because they would have put on sheep's skin over a wolf's heart.""")

t(27, 335, """This analysis is important for every person because it ends with a conclusion built on life experience, and it is a very important conclusion so that your minds are not toyed with in your lives and so that you do not pay exorbitant prices from your health and from the years of your lives, as millions paid who did not understand what I will explain in this post. The analysis is of two models of human beings who are among the strangest of people! The covert claimant of Mahdihood (Ahmad), known as Abu Abd al-Rahman, and another follower who follows the channel here and is completely detached from reason!

What did they do? Before we go to the analysis

When an ignorant person accuses you of ignorance, your exposing his ignorance is not haughtiness towards him! Let us look at these human models, the most astonishing among the models of human beings. I bring these examples so that we may learn together; we are here for nothing but learning. Two kinds of people I met on YouTube during this past week. A follower comes in and writes: “May Allah curse you and make you ugly.” Then he takes a new username and says: “You have no claim on me on the Day of Resurrection; I only prayed against you, I did not insult you!” He has deceived himself with this empty talk! And the owner of a dream-interpretation channel who sells indulgences to Muslims considered my exposing his ignorance to be haughtiness and arrogance towards him. He, like the first, deceives his own mind and fools himself! He forgot that he used my voice to tell people, “Look at this ignorant man who is speaking” (the servant in need of Allah). He did not understand that accusing someone else of ignorance calls for a reply. For whatever your position, minister, official, ruler, mosque imam, cheese seller in a grocery, teacher, doctor, restaurant owner, shop owner, if you are described as ignorant, or as a thief, or as doing something wrong, and you stay silent, the issue is not your person; the issue is a whole system and a whole circle surrounding you. So the seller of indulgences to Muslims, the covert claimant of Mahdihood known as Abu Abd al-Rahman, displayed my voice while I was speaking and then said to people: “Look! This man is ignorant and does not know what he is saying!” He, as his devil spurred and deceived him, wants to bring others down through his own ignorance. Would that he brought them down with truth and justice, so that we could say this is the right act to protect people from their misguidance and evil. But he wants to bring people down through his own ignorance and foolishness; then, when the corruption of his mind is shown to people and the extent of his ignorance is shown to people, he says: “Whoever exposed my reality is conceited and arrogant!”

The explanation of the two cases is finished. The comment:
These two models, according to what life experience has yielded, are liars and deceivers. This kind of people are not ignorant of what they do; rather, they fully realise what they are doing. Whatever their place in your life, do not believe that they are ignorant in their behaviour and do not know what they are doing to people! They are ignorant in their thinking and in their minds, but at the level of behaviour they know very well what they are doing. So do not treat these cases as cases that did not mean it, cases that did not notice the mistake they made, and cases unaware of what they are doing! All of that is empty talk. These are cases that know very well, acting with premeditation and lying in wait; they know very well what they are doing and know very well what they are embarking on before they do it. It is important that we learn this, because this post may spare you the waste of your life with harmful kinds of people like these, spare you your effort and your time, and save you from their draining your energy and toying with you.""")

t(27, 2245, """The end of the days of the manipulative “Big Brother”!

Western technological superiority since the First Industrial Revolution has always been the secular justification that Europe's leaders put forward in their continual drive to regard Europe as the world's big brother! The broad primitive industrial revolution that took place in China preceded any industrial revolution in Europe, and yet the Chinese did not regard themselves as the big brother of Europe or of the world, while Europe imported from them fireworks, ceramics, silk and many products that Europe could not manufacture with the same Chinese quality in the Middle Ages!

The Western mentality tends to regard Europe and the West as the world's big brother, and far from the big brother's""")

t(28, 160, """presumed morality in utopian thought, which the West never once in its history truly embraced. Yet this big brother was never a big brother at all; rather, he was always a trickster with history, circumventing the roles in it, and bolting towards a show of superiority from a psychological motive of his own that has nothing to do with the notion that says: “We manufacture, therefore we rule!” The issue was never industry; it was always the desire for supremacy by any means! Modern industry was used to serve the project of supremacy at any price! But industry is not an eternal god who does not die! The Lord alone is the Living who does not die. Industry is an idol or a tree! And today, after it has turned into an idol the West worships and is no longer a fruitful tree, the Lord alone is able to correct the West's course and turn the idol into a heap of dust, so that the West will be wringing its hands over what it spent on it (industry). Then the Almighty Lord, hallowed be His names, will say to another nation: “I have made you inherit what I stripped from them.” On that day the West will realise that the world does not stand upright on the big-brother method they wanted, but only on the big-brother method that Allah the Exalted wants.

As for the universality of Islam, it is the universality of the big brother in that very old Western utopian philosophical dream. It fell to the West to dream of the virtuous city and fail to establish it, because it is another nation that will, by Allah's leave, establish that old dream! And today the West is living its last moments as big brother in all of history, because after what is coming, the West will not be the world's big brother until the Day of Resurrection.""")

t(28, 1230, """A word with a reminder for our people in the beloved Strip

When there was talk a year ago of displacing the Palestinians from the Strip, and someone at the time chewed it in his mouth like gum and kept repeating morning and evening, “They will come to Egypt, they will invade Egypt, they will eat up Egypt's bounties, Egypt will perish because of them!”, I attacked him fiercely at the time, because he wronged a people who never sold their homeland! And I said to our people in the Strip: no displacement, by the power of your Almighty Lord.

Today the world is nearing preoccupation with things a thousand times more important than emptying the Strip and displacing its people. And as I mentioned to you, our beloved ones in the Strip, two years ago and more: I saw you 12 or 13 years ago, I do not remember the year, in a vision; I saw you living on top of the rubble, and the whole land destroyed. But in the vision there was no bombardment on you and no hardship, except rubble you were suffering from and a halt to the normal form of life. It was a vision in which the Third World War had laid down its burdens and died out.
I repeat the reminder because the scaremongers among you, inside the Strip and outside it, are many: hirelings, ignorant people, and others of weak souls who do not grasp the reality of the test that has befallen you and so declare their impatience with the test.""")

t(28, 2110, """Two years, and the Strip is not an oil state like Venezuela with an army, a homeland, a state and an entity, yet they could not get their sons back except by negotiation! Whereas just two months of tracking Maduro and his movements were enough for him to fall in a humiliating, degrading condition! For 15 years I have been writing and saying: in our Ummah there are minds that, if they believe with true faith, neither human nor jinn can defeat, except by a rope from Allah the Exalted, for a profound divine wisdom. Our region will remain a source of will and will reap many successes in the future, by Allah's leave .. Maduro and his naivety remind me of the naivety of Che Guevara! A revolutionary is not merely a resounding voice! A revolutionary is a leader, and a leader never falls captive!""")

t(29, 260, """It is too early to judge the success of the American operation! Kidnapping a president is one thing, and controlling the country is another! The events on the ground are what matter most""")

t(29, 595, """I have just got my driving licence! If you see this sign, do not treat me as a seasoned driver .. In society there are the young in age; when they ask, they are entitled to an answer, and when they argue, we have seen the (novice) sign, so we choose silence by blocking, not arguing and wearying the heart .. But a young man comes to me who argues, disputes and contends, and turns abusive in speech merely because he was blocked, although blocking is not an insult; yet he comes with another username and insults. This is the habit of all those raised by the groups of political Islam! So far I have not seen anything different, but I do not generalise. So I see on this kind of people the sign (new) .. (novice), like this sign that is customary in Japan for new drivers. O my brother, younger than me in age, between me and you are long years of difference in knowledge, understanding, life experience and expertise, and your arguing does not serve me. Your arguing wastes my time! So go away with your idea, which I have answered you about; but you are kneaded through and through with argument. Argue about your idea between you and yourself, far from me, for you do not know, and had you known you would have grasped it. Your mind, and what you suckled from your political affiliation to the groups, is not a scale of right and wrong as they taught you! If they taught you a thinking like this, they have ruined you! Go, my brother, to those who taught you, and waste their time as you wish! You are not a pupil of mine, nor of the likes of me here in this gathering! You are not a pupil of this gathering! You are a pupil of an intellectual structure upon which other people built you, whom we do not know! And we have not met them! You are the intellectual legacy of people other than us, so why should we bear the burden of those who taught you and planted this seedling in you?! Did we plant it, that we should reap it? What is our fault?!""")

t(30, 160, """The Venezuelans betrayed their president! The elite betrayed him! Infiltrators inside the elite betrayed him! His recklessness with his personal security undid him! His trust in the wrong men undid him! His lack of caution undid him! His casual handling of his personal security undid him! His failure to manage his personal security and to set strict rules to thwart his being targeted undid him! Maduro was lost because he did not deserve the place he was put in! This is one of the forms and kinds of the saying of the Prophet ﷺ: “When the matter is entrusted to those unfit for it”! This is what always happens when the lands and the people are led by one who is not qualified .. one who does not realise and understand that his personal security is sacred, because his fall may mean the fall of an entire nation! When a president fails to protect himself, there occur calamities, disasters, defeats and disgrace that the years will not erase and history will not forget, and the people's condition never returns afterwards to what it was before! It is easy tomorrow to present Venezuela as a country to which life has returned! But that will be in exchange for handing over its wealth .. In Venezuela there is something the like of which China possesses (rare minerals), and China does not want it handed to the United States .. What is declared, and I do not much agree with it, is their saying: in Venezuela there is an oil lifeline for China as an alternative to the Arabian Gulf! But China has an easy geographical connection with oil-rich Russia!

Venezuela, then, is an important station among the stations of smashing and encircling China. In Beijing today, where its governing compound is, there is a morning unlike yesterday's morning! In the world there is a shudder running today through the body of this world, because if Venezuela is seized, that means bringing the third great war closer; not because Venezuela is the Kuwait of the Arabian Gulf in 1990, when it was the collective national security of the Gulf, but because Venezuela is the Kuwait of China in 2026, when it is the collective national security of China and Russia together! For whatever touches China today touches Russia, and vice versa! The paradox is that in the 1990 crisis the United States was, before the world, the rescuer, the saviour and the good policeman, whereas today, in the 2026 crisis, the United States is the aggressor!

Even so, China and Russia still fear the United States, and everyone sees that fear; the reactions of the two global powers must not be viewed through the lens of emotion! The great war is the product of the growing volume of sighs in the chest! China and Russia today heave a new sigh in the chest! The seizure of Venezuela is part of the finger-breaking war between China and the United States, but it is not necessarily the spark! Iraq in 1990 was an exhausted state .. The United States in 2026 is not Iraq! In summary: the seizure of Venezuela is an additional message to China, and not necessarily the last of the messages! Nor will China today necessarily rebel completely; but what is certain is that it will not retreat from complete rebellion after Venezuela, even if its complete rebellion is delayed a week, a month or three!""")

t(30, 1830, """The basic rule for women other than the Mothers of the Believers is that they be disciplined in going out of the house, going out within the known moral limits and standards. If they do that, nothing bad will befall Muslim society, women or men. As for needs and necessities, they are many:
🔴 Visiting her parents
🔴 Visiting her sisters
🔴 Visiting her brothers
🔴 Visiting her maternal and paternal aunts in an environment with no temptation for her
🔴 Visiting her grandparents in an environment with no temptation for her
🔴 Visiting her married children, sons and daughters
🔴 Going to the women's hospital
🔴 Going out with her family and a group of her women friends and sitting in places reserved for women only

And by this analogy the necessities vary

As for the necessities, they are not confined to the grave when she dies; that is not necessarily the only necessity in a Muslim woman's life. The grave is a necessity for the body, but the human being was not created from a body only, but from a soul as well. So where are the necessities of the soul? How can a woman stay in her house and leave it only for a hospital, or for the dying of a father and mother, or …""")

t(31, 150, """… to her grave to be buried?

For the last time, because the subject has been given its due .. A woman has the right to enjoy all the delights of this world outside the home, just like a man, but on condition of the Shariah limits, and that those delights and pleasures be suitable to her being a woman, and that she enjoy them according to the moral conditions that Islam has specified and made clear. Full stop.""")

t(31, 740, """A respected sister put forward an opinion about the need to compel women to abide by the directive revealed concerning the Mothers of the Believers, to stay in their houses, because of wrong practices that Muslim women engage in today, such as loitering in markets and cafes. The reply was given, but I am conveying it here separately for the general benefit.

It is not right for us to legislate in our religion a law that Allah the Almighty, our Lord, did not legislate, because this is disbelief that takes one out of Islam. If Allah the Exalted did not say, in His revelation which He, hallowed be His names, sent down 1447 years ago, to all Muslim women “And stay in your houses”, and the command was specific to the wives of the Prophet ﷺ, and then I come and say to Allah the Almighty, 1447 years after the revelation: “O Lord, the people have become corrupt, so I will, on Your behalf, amend the verse and say that it is for Muslim women in general”, then this is disbelief that takes one out of Islam.

The basic rule is that the Muslim submits to the verse “as it is”, and then makes from it his correct, disciplined social model, benefiting from the spirit of the verse, not taking the verse as a ruling of lawful and unlawful; for the Mothers of the Believers themselves used to go out after this verse, and it is clear that they did not understand the verse as commanding them to make their houses graves above the earth from which they would go out only to the graves in the belly of the earth. Muslim society becomes disciplined, yes, but not by changing the Book of Allah and its texts.

Muslim society becomes disciplined through the discipline of its men in their houses with their women, not by changing a verse in the Book of Allah. Corruption exists in every time and place throughout all of Islamic history. Adultery occurred in the noble era of Prophethood and in Madinah itself, and the Prophet ﷺ did not say: “Make two quarters in Madinah, a quarter where only men live with a wall built around it, and a quarter where only women live with a wall built around it.” The problems of society are not changed by denying people their human rights concerning none of which a text has come denying that it is a right, as with adultery, drinking wine, usury, killing, insulting people and doing evil, all of which are not rights. But when the Book legislates, and the Sunnah follows it, that Muslim women are guaranteed going out of the house within limits, and then I come, because of the corruption of society, and lay down a legislation of which there is no mention in the Book and the Sunnah and no explicit, clear basis, this is alteration, and this is a door of great evil; if it is opened, adherence to the Qur'anic texts as they are will vanish, and every mujtahid will begin changing the Book of Allah as he pleases!""")

t(31, 2180, """The most misguided of Allah's creation that I have seen in my life are people who prophesy: this one, in their view, is of the people of Paradise and that one of the people of the Fire, by the feeling of the heart! How bold they are against Allah! They are advised and reminded of the truth and of what is right, yet they are haughty and arrogant towards the advice. These transgressors against one of the attributes of the Almighty Lord, the Creator, do not know how much disbelief they commit and how much harm they produce for the people around them; they hurt them in those dearest to them! These people in your homes and in your lives, if they exist, are too rare to be a visible multitude; if they exist, I doubt they exceed 1% of people. It is not right to stay silent about their disbelief in Allah and their audacity in classifying so-and-so and so-and-so as of the people of Paradise and of the people of the Fire merely because their sinful hearts felt a feeling! For their persistence will bring them to complete disbelief, like Musaylimah and like Sajah.""")
